claim.claim-text:
an operation lever (130) that is rotatable in a first rotation direction about a first rotation shaft (144) and rotatable in a second rotation direction about a second rotation shaft (143) non-parallel to the first rotation shaft (144);
an urging portion (136) that urges the operation lever (130) to move to a predetermined initial position;
a first cam portion (170) that rotates following a rotation of the operation lever (130) in the first rotation direction;
a second cam portion (150) that rotates following a rotation of the operation lever (130) in the second rotation direction;
a first switch portion (190) that is pressed by the first cam portion (170) and detects the pressing in a state where the first cam portion (170) is rotated to a predetermined position; and
a second switch portion (200) that is pressed by the second cam portion (150) and detects the pressing in a state where the second cam portion (150) is rotated to a predetermined position, wherein
the operation lever (130) is movable to a plurality of operation positions, the operation device (100) further comprising:
